    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addendum 4 &#x2013; Increase by &#xa3;19,078.17 or NAD 413,189. This is to increase the funds by &#xa3;24,769.17, to cover part of a Programme Manager Role in Namibia Red Cross until Dec 2021. This is equal to NAD 476,330.20. &#xa0;&#xa0;This is covering 33% of the PM role from Sept 2020 &#x2013; April 2021. Then 70% from May 2021 &#x2013; December. 
This is also to be increase by &#xa3;730 to cover the recruitment costs. Making the total to be increased by being &#xa3;25,499.17. 
NRCS has a surplus balance in the account of NAD 115,693.94 which is around &#xa3; 6,016. Therefore, BRC will be sending &#xa3;19,808.17 or NAD 380,926.34</narrative>
   </description>
